            "created_at": "2025-07-20T15:49:33.780192+00:00",
            "notes": "You want to get [Trinisphere](item_ffaf0527-137c-4fa6-8048-82f2c99f6d56) on round 1 because\n\n1. It acts like a near 25% damage increase to your primary fire\n2. It starts scaling as early as round 2 thanks to [Velocity Vector](item_5ad7884b-ac8c-42f4-a5ad-359f43270540) and it only gets much stronger\n\nThe greens are the usual weapon power greens, although [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) could also be good.",
