            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-20T15:49:33.780192+00:00",
            "notes": "This, of course, is where the fun begins.\n\n[Velocity Vector](item_5ad7884b-ac8c-42f4-a5ad-359f43270540) is your best friend for the rest of the game. Do not ever take it off. The increased range is extremely useful when fighting ranged characters and flyers and makes you a cross-map threat. It also gives 10% attack speed to boot.\n\nAt this stage, look for anything that can increase your attack speed as much as possible. The damage increase from [Trinisphere](item_ffaf0527-137c-4fa6-8048-82f2c99f6d56)  should hold up for now. If you can't afford all the items, I like to buy wrist wraps and buy greens accordingly instead of  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)",
