            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-20T15:49:33.780192+00:00",
            "notes": "[Hyperloop](item_aea2ba3d-76a7-44f1-b12f-88a04f4d68bb) is another integral power and one of the two absolute necessary powers for this build. Any power after that is just extra, although I tend to pick [Symphonic Syzygy](item_e5b404ff-5b4c-4ca1-9d01-f5f797db222c) for round 5.\n\n[Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) is really good because not only does it do a ton of damage against flyers, you may have heard that it seemingly works randomly on any enemy when playing Sigma, even when they're on the ground. Perhaps it's because they jump?\n\nIf you can't afford [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204), start investing a little into weapon power, although [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) becomes necessary starting at round 4.\n\n[Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is another good item depending on the matchup. If the scenario presents itself for [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) and you can't afford [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204), get [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66)  instead",
