        {
            "id": "5eb1505b-6347-42f3-8e22-ea9d2676bac3",
            "build_id": "2c330e7b-b493-4618-99e8-36d31ba2e7ec",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-20T15:49:33.780192+00:00",
            "notes": "[Symphonic Syzygy](item_e5b404ff-5b4c-4ca1-9d01-f5f797db222c) is my go-to for round 5 to turn your already monstrous barrage even more relentless, but if you're going against a Mei, ABSOLUTELY get [Zero Gravity](item_0a50d243-06bd-4026-a916-2a25d27b4556) instead. By this point Mei is likely doing deadly damage while trapping you with her wall. Your best attempt at survival never involves fighting the Mei, you *will* lose. [Zero Gravity](item_0a50d243-06bd-4026-a916-2a25d27b4556) is good for escaping her icy clutches and with [Hyperloop](item_aea2ba3d-76a7-44f1-b12f-88a04f4d68bb) you get a decent bit of airtime.\n\nif against a Reinhardt, consider getting [Astrophysical](item_7749452f-3c0e-45a9-9c32-f561aa7fb41e) instead. If against a Reinhardt and a Mei, get [Zero Gravity](item_0a50d243-06bd-4026-a916-2a25d27b4556).\n\n[Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) by this point becomes necessary. Retire [Maglev Multiplier](item_a842eb8b-983b-4560-9af6-923776a2a2a8) and replace it with a big weapon power upgrade if possible, but if not then keep [Maglev Multiplier](item_a842eb8b-983b-4560-9af6-923776a2a2a8).",
