            "notes": "You want to sell [Maglev Multiplier](item_a842eb8b-983b-4560-9af6-923776a2a2a8) because you can get enough weapon power that you're doing that kind of damage constantly. If you still can't afford the weapon power epics, keep  [Maglev Multiplier](item_a842eb8b-983b-4560-9af6-923776a2a2a8).  [Antimatter](item_80887501-7855-40af-ab3c-c8c13a259e95) is pretty good but depending on the matchup and how confident you are at hitting shots, it should be the first item you swap out for other weapon power upgrades. When going against barrier-heavy enemies, [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) is just much better.",
